From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sargun Vohra <sargunv@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 23:26:39 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 4/8] Carry plugin rotation properties

Adds MLN_PLUGIN_VALUE_ROTATION to the plugin layer ABI: degrees in
float_value whose transitions follow the shortest arc, like the built-in
rotation properties. Not yet proposed upstream.

Carried by maplibre-plugins from maplibre-native-ffi PR #731 until it lands
upstream.
